      "cost": "Each carrier dimension1..64, table length1..4096. Admission, lookup-table composition, inverse and local-factor checks are O(left*right); apply is O(1) after fixed point validation. Parallel dimensions are checked before at most4096 lookups. Only the fixed4-state fixture enumerates permutations (24), never an arbitrary user carrier. Default18 obligations =5 controlled-permutation+13 cloning controls.",
