        {
          "requirement": "Recreate the deterministic300-case rank family locally per invocation, including rectangular and deficient matrices. Check rank(A M B^T)<=rank(M), count all300 attempts and report91 strict decreases. Independent forward elimination must reproduce all600 rank observations and both displayed counts.",
